<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ λόφων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.97
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.2.1
			</span></i>; of ships, <i>run into port</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς Πειραιᾶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.1.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make inroads</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πόλεις</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.2.43
			</span></i>: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Χώραν</span>
			<i>overrun, ravage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.4.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. θάλατταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					1.23.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>attack, persecute</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Parth.
				13.3
			</span></i> cod.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς τετελευτηκότας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					63.42
				</span></i>
			; esp. <i>in argument, 'run down</i>', <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				171c
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατρέχω</span>: c. gen.,
				<i>treat insultingly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τοῦ αὐτοκράτορος ἡλικίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
